# Identity project

Agent skill: [.cursor/skills/identity-agent/SKILL.md](../skills/identity-agent/SKILL.md)

## Scope

`identity/frontend`, `identity/backend`, `identity/backend/migrations` — standalone auth service.

## Ports and env

| Layer | Port | Env file |
|-------|------|----------|
| Frontend | 3001 | `identity/frontend/.env` (`VITE_*` only) |
| Backend | 4001 | `identity/backend/.env` |

Backend loads only `identity/backend/.env` (not repo root or other services).

## Ownership

- Login, register, forgot/reset password UI + APIs.
- JWT **issuance**; redirect mode via `redirect_uri` + auth code exchange.
- Database: `identity` (MySQL).

## Platform shell — reference implementation (profile)

Identity profile is the **canonical template** for all cross-service redirection. See [platform-shell-navigation.mdc](platform-shell-navigation.mdc).

| Role | Path |
|------|------|
| Inbound layout | `identity/frontend/src/app/AppLayout.tsx` |
| Inbound home + bootstrap | `identity/frontend/src/features/profile/pages/ProfilePage.tsx` |
| Bootstrap util | `identity/frontend/src/features/profile/utils/bootstrapProfileSession.ts` |
| Return URL util | `identity/frontend/src/features/profile/utils/profileReturn.ts` |
| Core nav | `identity/frontend/src/features/shell/config/navItems.ts` |
| Outbound Email (consumer pattern) | `identity/frontend/src/app/AppLayout.tsx` `handleEmailClick`, `features/email/utils/redirectToEmail.ts` |

## Integration

- WebOnOne `/login` → Identity `redirect_uri`; `/callback` on WebOnOne for standalone OAuth only.
- WebOnOne → Profile: `handleProfileClick` + `redirectToIdentityProfile.ts` (consumer).
- Identity/ WebOnOne → Email: `handleEmailClick` + `redirectToEmail.ts` — **no** `/go/*` route.
- Embed login: `identity/frontend` login embed mode; `webonone-v2/frontend/src/features/auth/utils/identityConfig.ts`.

Cross-service rules: [microservice-architecture.mdc](microservice-architecture.mdc), [platform-shell-navigation.mdc](platform-shell-navigation.mdc).

